Package: objectExplorerR
Title: Interactive Shiny Explorer for Ontology Objects
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cathalbyrne@example.com")
Description: A Shiny-based interactive explorer for ontology objects defined
    by ontologySpecR. Users can search, filter, traverse links, and inspect
    ontology objects visually without writing code. Supports auto-generated
    filters from property types, link traversal for relationship navigation,
    and integration with actionTypesR for action execution and vertexR for
    graph visualization. Uses objectSetsR for all data access.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CathalByrneGit/objectExplorerR
